      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>My understanding as an Alpha tester is that the hit due to Friendly Fire is one instance of damage. &nbsp; Jack Handle then stops that one instance of damage from hitting Setback and instead delivers that one hit to each non-hero target. &nbsp;So this is why you get only two hits. &nbsp; Once from his strike and once from trying to hit Setback due to Friendly Fire. &nbsp;</p>",
