      "created_at": "2016-09-18T21:23:51.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>This will be in the next Fireside Chat update:</p><p><span><span>Suppose Mr. Fixer would deal 1 damage to a target. Due to Jack Handle, </span></span><span>Mr. Fixer deals the 1 damage to all non-hero targets, then Friendly Fire lets him deal 2 to Setback, which becomes 2 to all non-hero targets, and then stops. Setback does not get to add 2 tokens to his Unlucky Pool, as he was not damaged this way.</span></p><div>&nbsp;</div>",
