      "raw": "<p>This will be in the next Fireside Chat update:</p><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-813c7dbc-3f2d-8d21-138b-991c995d85b8\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.666666666666666px; font-family: Arial; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Suppose Mr. Fixer would deal 1 damage to a target. Due to Jack Handle, </span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(56, 118, 29); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.666666666666666px; font-weight: 700; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Mr. Fixer deals the 1 damage to all non-hero targets, then Friendly Fire lets him deal 2 to Setback, which becomes 2 to all non-hero targets, and then stops. Setback does not get to add 2 tokens to his Unlucky Pool, as he was not damaged this way.</span></p><div>&nbsp;</div>",
