      "created_at": "2016-09-19T05:35:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>That may be the intention, but that's not what actually happens. &nbsp;Unfortuantely, I've already overwritten my log files, but when I had two Friendly Fires and Jack Handle, I got 4 triggers off of each Strike.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>EDIT: &nbsp;I've played it again, and here is the log file.</p>",
