      "created_at": "2016-09-25T22:46:42.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>To clarify a situation that came up in a game I played this afternoon, Xtreme Fanatic's Kill the Spirit should work the same way, correct? That is:</p><p>Fanatic deals damage while KtS' redirection is active.</p><p>Friendly Fire triggers and attempts to have Fanatic deal 2 to Setback.</p><p>KtS redirects the damage.</p><p>Loop ends here because Friendly Fire can't trigger off its own damage instance.</p>",
      "post_number": 11,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:07:29.976Z",
